{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MEGADEKA</strong> is a simulation game where you defend your base from a giant woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At some point, the giant \u201cHer\u201d began living in this country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She crushes parts of the city beneath her feet and shakes the earth with her breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We must defend the city from Her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We must predict what She will do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even today, I can see the giant Her sleeping from the window of the top-floor room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679390/extras/megadeka_616x158_001.png?t=1746439507\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A simulation game where you defend your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Predict the disasters caused by Her and choose objects inside the room accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No quest markers or time limits\u2014you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no visible stats; the situation is reflected by changes in the room\u2019s objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your score increases based on your actions\u2014aim for a high score by the end of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t make Her angry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> 30 to 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679390/extras/megadeka_store_616x158_002.png?t=1746439507\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 <strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both individuals and organizations may 